          "title": "You'll want to know: آبیاری کردن",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "آبیاری کردن (âbyâri kardan) — \"to water (plants)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پدرم عصرها گلها را آبیاری میکند. pedaram 'asrhâ golhâ râ âbyâri mikonad. My father waters the flowers in the afternoons."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "âbyâri 'irrigation' + kardan. In speech also âb dâdan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "âbyâri is built on native âb, 'water', which EtymDB traces to Middle Persian (EtymDB); the rest is usually explained as yâri, 'help': helping with water. kardan is inherited."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
